# Answers that are not a line and a column: "Invalid line or column number", the cursor stays.
args: lines.txt
file lines.txt:
| first line
| second
| third
keys: {Down}{Right*2}
keys: {^_}x{Enter}
keys: {^_}1,{Enter}
keys: {^_}1 2{Enter}
keys: {^_}2 {Enter}
keys: {^_}1,2,3{Enter}
keys: {^_}3;2{Enter}
keys: {^_}-{Enter}
keys: {^_}99999999999999999999{Enter}
keys: {^_},{Enter}
keys: {^C}
keys: {^X}
